{"id":"c033869601b29cc8","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-robinson-joint-consistency.md","title":"Robinson Joint Consistency Theorem","display":"thm-robinson-joint-consistency — Robinson Joint Consistency Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"2.2","source_result":"Local common-language separation criterion from Craig 2.2.20; Robinson 2.2.23 is the complete-common-theory special case","source_pages_print":"91","source_pages_djvu":"107","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-robinson-joint-consistency","aliases":["17-thm-robinson-joint-consistency"],"display":"thm-robinson-joint-consistency — Robinson Joint Consistency Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-joint-consistency]]","[[17-df-language-operations]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-9.2.1b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Local common-language separation criterion from Craig 2.2.20; Robinson 2.2.23 is the complete-common-theory special case"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"91"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"107"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-robinson-joint-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-robinson-joint-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-robinson-joint-consistency — Robinson Joint Consistency Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a712e15961f1e3d\" href=\"?note=5a712e15961f1e3d\" title=\"17-df-joint-consistency\">17-df-joint-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c533bc9800efd71c\" href=\"?note=c533bc9800efd71c\" title=\"17-df-language-operations\">17-df-language-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-9.2.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_1,L_2)\">\\(\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_1,L_2)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\">\\(L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\">\\(L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\\)</span> 均为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c533bc9800efd71c\" href=\"?note=c533bc9800efd71c\" title=\"17-df-language-operations\">17-df-language-operations</a> 的分量运算。理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}\">\\(T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}\\)</span> 的模型类与后承按各自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_i\">\\(L_i\\)</span> 解释。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\">\\(L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\">\\(L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\\)</span> (compatible languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5a712e15961f1e3d\" href=\"?note=5a712e15961f1e3d\" title=\"17-df-joint-consistency\">17-df-joint-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}\\)</span> (sentence classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent}\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (consistency and semantic consequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}\\)</span> (joint consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5a712e15961f1e3d\" href=\"?note=5a712e15961f1e3d\" title=\"17-df-joint-consistency\">17-df-joint-consistency</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\n\\land\nL=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\n\\land\nT_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\n\\land\nT_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_2}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_1)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}(T_1,T_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\bigl(\nT_1\\models\\sigma\n\\land\nT_2\\models\\neg\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\n\\land\nL=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\n\\land\nT_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\n\\land\nT_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_2}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_1)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}(T_1,T_2)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\bigl(\nT_1\\models\\sigma\n\\land\nT_2\\models\\neg\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Joint consistency fails exactly when a sentence in the common language separates the two theories. No unrelated “infinite language” assumption is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-joint-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"5a712e15961f1e3d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-joint-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"c533bc9800efd71c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"c533bc9800efd71c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_1,L_2)$。$L_0=L_1\\cap L_2$ 和 $L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2$ 均为 [[17-df-language-operations]] 的分量运算。理论 $T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}$ 的模型类与后承按各自 $L_i$ 解释。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_0=L_1\\cap L_2$ and $L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2$ (compatible languages, see [[17-df-first-order-language]] and [[17-df-joint-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-joint-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"5a712e15961f1e3d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_0=L_1\\cap L_2$ and $L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2$ (compatible languages, see [[17-df-first-order-language]] and [[17-df-joint-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}$ (sentence classes, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Consistent}$ and $\\models$ (consistency and semantic consequence, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-joint-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"5a712e15961f1e3d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}$ (joint consistency, see [[17-df-joint-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_1,L_2)","display":false},{"tex":"L_0=L_1\\cap L_2","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_i\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}","display":false},{"tex":"L_i","display":false},{"tex":"L_0=L_1\\cap L_2","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_i}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Consistent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&L_0=L_1\\cap L_2\n\\land\nL=L_1\\cup_{L_0}L_2\n\\land\nT_1\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_1}\n\\land\nT_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_2}\n\\\\\n&\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_1)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T_2)\n\\\\\n&\\to\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{JointConsistent}_{L_1,L_2}(T_1,T_2)\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{8mm}\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\bigl(\nT_1\\models\\sigma\n\\land\nT_2\\models\\neg\\sigma\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2378,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraprodu